<hr/><p>08.10.2026 10:29 Political News</p><h3>Russian troops launch 31 strikes across Donetsk region, killing 4 – official</h3><p class=MsoNormal>KYIV. Oct 8 (Interfax-Ukraine) – Russian occupation forces subjected settlements across Donetsk region to 31 attacks over the past 24 hours, Head of the Donetsk Regional State Administration Vadym Filashkin reported.</p>
<p class=MsoNormal>"Over October 7, the Russians killed 4 residents of Donetsk region: 2 in Zelenе, and 1 each in Slovyansk and Vesela Hora. Another 6 people in the region sustained injuries over the past day," Filashkin wrote on his Telegram channel.</p>
<p class=MsoNormal>Specifically, in Slovyansk, 1 person was killed and 3 were wounded, with damage inflicted on an apartment building, an administrative building, a shop, a service station, a gas station, a car, and a bus. In Kramatorsk, a person was wounded and three cars were damaged.</p>
<p class=MsoNormal>Two administrative buildings were damaged in Oleksandrivka; in Zoloti Prudy, a person was injured and a private house, a car, and a truck sustained damage; private homes were damaged in Petrivka Persha and Novostepanivka. In Vesela Hora within the Novodonetske community, a person was killed and a private house damaged; an administrative building was damaged in Stepanivka. In Serhiivka of the Andriivka community, 7 houses were damaged. In Druzhkivka, one person was injured.</p>
<p class=MsoNormal>In Zelene within the Kryvyi Rih community, 2 people were killed.</p>
<p class=MsoNormal>A total of 256 people, including 32 children, were evacuated from the frontline zone over the past 24 hours.</p>
<hr/><p>08.10.2026 10:32 Фінанси</p><h3>Операції НБУ з регулювання ліквідності банків</h3><p class=MsoNormal>Київ. 8 жовтня. ІНТЕРФАКС-УКРАЇНА – Нацбанк України (НБУ) приводить дані з регулювання ліквідності банків на 7 жовтня 2026 року.</p>
<p class=MsoNormal>Операції НБУ з мобілізації коштів банків шляхом розміщення депозитних сертифікатів</p>
