<hr/><p>08.10.2026 12:23 Political News</p><h3>Sybiha: Lithuania allocates EUR 15 mln more for Ukraine's recovery, resilience via World Bank, EIB</h3><p class=MsoNormal>KYIV. Oct 8 (Interfax-Ukraine) – Lithuania has allocated an additional EUR 15 million for Ukraine's recovery and resilience enhancement projects, with the funds to be channeled through the mechanisms of the World Bank and the European Investment Bank (EIB), Minister of Foreign Affairs of Ukraine Andrii Sybiha reported on Wednesday evening.</p>
